---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Security Policy & Vulnerability Disclosure" 
  description="Security standards, scope, and confidential vulnerability disclosure guidelines for Cyber Scotland Connect."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="border-b border-[#3e3c66] pb-8 mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6fb7e6] block mb-1">
        Integrity & Safety
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight">
        Security Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#bdaccf] text-base mt-2">
        Cyber Scotland Connect takes the security of our community infrastructure and members seriously.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-[#bdaccf] space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="bg-[#2a2948] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#3e3c66]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Supported Scope</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">This security policy applies to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>The <a href="https://github.com/cyber-scotland-connect/csc-website" class="text-[#6fb7e6] underline">CSC Website Repository</a></li>
          <li>Hosted static assets under <code class="text-pink-300">cyber-scotland-connect.github.io/csc-website</code> and associated custom domains.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-[#2a2948] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#3e3c66]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Confidential Disclosure</h2>
        <div class="p-4 bg-[#1b1a30] rounded-lg border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-200 text-sm mb-6">
          <strong>⚠️ Please DO NOT report security vulnerabilities through public GitHub issues.</strong>
        </div>

        <p class="mb-4">If you believe you have discovered a vulnerability or misconfiguration:</p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li>
            <strong>GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting (Preferred):</strong><br />
            Submit a confidential advisory directly via the 
            <a href="https://github.com/cyber-scotland-connect/csc-website/security/advisories/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#6fb7e6] underline">
              GitHub Security Advisory Tab ↗
            </a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Direct Contact:</strong><br />
            Email the core maintainers at <a href="mailto:security@cyberscotlandconnect.com" class="text-[#6fb7e6] underline">security@cyberscotlandconnect.com</a>.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-[#1b1a30] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#3e3c66]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Response Commitments</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#2a2948] rounded border border-[#3e3c66]">
            <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">48 Hours</span>
            Initial acknowledgment of incoming report.
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#2a2948] rounded border border-[#3e3c66]">
            <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">5 Business Days</span>
            Triage, assessment, and reproduction update.
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#2a2948] rounded border border-[#3e3c66]">
            <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">Coordinated Fix</span>
            Collaborative disclosure with reporter credit.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
